  m_text: 'Move Body

    Use the left stick to move.

    Your movement direction
    follows where your head is looking.


    Turn Body

    Use the right stick
    to turn left or right.


    Move Up & Down

    Look at your right controller
    and press the two buttons near your thumb to move up or down.


    Grab Data

    Use
    the trigger (middle finger) to grab and move data.


    Bring / Push Data

    While
    holding data, move the right stick forward or backward to pull it closer or push
    it away.'
